  "details": "Hello, I've been noticing a strange issue that seemed to occure with avatars when I adjust height after loading into them. When moving backwards or forwards the feet would lift off the ground as if they were swimming. The issue seems to go away upon the avatar being reloaded after adjustment. This does not occur at all when using fbt, only with 3 point tracking. Was able to reproduce it on various random avatar.   \nHere is an example video of the problem. \nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0_0ljalzD34",
